        "step_LLLMTK": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "number": "",
            "title": "Check You’re Ready to Start",
            "text": "<p>You don’t need prior teaching experience to begin your journey as a <a href=\"/products/active-iq-level-3-diploma-in-instructing-pilates-matwork\" title=\"CIMSPA Endorsed Level 3 Diploma in Instructing Pilates Matwork with 4-Day Immersive Residential\">Pilates instructor. </a></p><p>To get the most from your course, it helps to have: </p><ul><li>A basic level of fitness  </li><li>An interest in movement, anatomy, and wellbeing  </li><li>Strong communication skills  </li></ul><p>With Study Active, you can start your Pilates instructor training without needing previous fitness qualifications. </p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "step_AbJtEA": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "number": "",
            "title": "Enrol on a Recognised Level 3 Pilates course ",
            "text": "<p>To become a Pilates instructor, you’ll need a regulated qualification such as the <strong>Active IQ Level 3 Diploma in Instructing Pilates Matwork</strong>. </p><p>Study Active delivers this course fully online, giving you the flexibility to study at your own pace while gaining industry-recognised certification. </p><p>You’ll cover: </p><ul><li>Pilates principles and techniques  </li><li>Functional anatomy and physiology  </li><li>Planning and delivering effective sessions  </li><li>Adapting exercises for different client needs  </li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "step_jihG8D": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "number": "",
            "title": "Develop Your Practical Teaching Skills ",
            "text": "<p>Becoming a great Pilates instructor isn’t just about theory - it’s about applying what you learn in real-world scenarios. </p><p>During your course, you’ll learn how to: </p><ul><li>Structure safe and engaging classes  </li><li>Demonstrate exercises with proper technique  </li><li>Use clear, effective cueing  </li><li>Adapt sessions for beginners through to advanced clients  </li></ul><p>You’ll also have access to tutor support from <strong>Study Active</strong> to help build your confidence as you progress. </p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "step_4y9FGm": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "number": "",
            "title": "Complete your assessments ",
            "text": "<p>To achieve your qualification, you’ll complete: </p><ul><li>Online theory coursework  </li><li>Practical assessments that demonstrate your ability to plan and deliver Pilates sessions  </li></ul><p>These ensure you meet industry standards and are ready to work with real clients. </p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "step_V7W7Xx": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "number": "",
            "title": "Get insured and start teaching",
            "text": "<p>Once qualified, you can gain instructor insurance and begin working as a Pilates instructor. </p><p>Typical career options include: </p><ul><li>Gyms and health clubs  </li><li>Pilates studios  </li><li>Freelance or self-employed work  </li><li>Online coaching  </li></ul>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "step_xm4ALy": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "number": "",
            "title": "Continue building your career",
            "text": "<p>As you gain experience, you can grow your career by: </p><ul><li>Offering 1-to-1 sessions  </li><li>Running group classes  </li><li>Developing specialist knowledge  </li><li>Building your own client base or brand  </li></ul><p>Study Active also provides ongoing support to help you take the next steps in your fitness career. </p>",
