    "v2_flexible_TawhVX": {
      "type": "v2_flexible",
      "blocks": {
        "headline_AU8XkH": {
          "type": "headline",
          "settings": {
            "heading_text": "<p>Why Choose a Career as a Pilates Instructor?</p><p></p>",
            "heading_align": "left",
            "heading_width": "full",
            "heading_type": "h3",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "heading_no_decal": false,
            "heading_decal_left": true,
            "heading_strong_accented": false
          }
        },
        "subheadline_pwBQpL": {
          "type": "subheadline",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Becoming a <a href=\"/products/active-iq-level-3-diploma-in-instructing-pilates-matwork\" title=\"CIMSPA Endorsed Level 3 Diploma in Instructing Pilates Matwork with 4-Day Immersive Residential\"><strong>Pilates instructor</strong></a> is a highly rewarding career choice for individuals passionate about movement, wellbeing, and helping others build strength from the inside out. With growing awareness around injury prevention, posture, and long-term health, Pilates continues to play a key role in the modern fitness industry.<br/></p>",
            "text_align": "left",
            "text_width": "full",
            "text_size": "copy-l",
            "text_no_decal": false,
            "text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 16,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "textcol_e4EdeH": {
          "type": "textcol",
          "settings": {
            "left_text": "<p></p><p><strong>High Industry Demand</strong><br/><br/>Pilates has seen significant growth across the UK, particularly among clients seeking low-impact, effective training methods that support strength, mobility, and rehabilitation.</p><p></p><p>From beginners to athletes and those recovering from injury, a wide range of clients are turning to Pilates - creating consistent demand for qualified instructors in gyms, studios, and wellness settings.<br/></p>",
            "left_text_size": "copy-l",
            "left_text_no_decal": false,
            "left_text_strong_accented": false,
            "right_text": "<p><br/><strong>Accessible Entry into a Specialist Fitness Career</strong></p><p></p><p>Becoming a Pilates instructor offers a clear pathway into a specialised area of the fitness industry. With a recognised qualification, such as a <a href=\"/products/active-iq-level-3-diploma-in-instructing-pilates-matwork\" title=\"CIMSPA Endorsed Level 3 Diploma in Instructing Pilates Matwork with 4-Day Immersive Residential\">Level 3 Diploma in Matwork Pilates</a>, you can begin teaching safely and effectively without needing prior industry experience.</p><p>This makes it an ideal option for those looking to enter the fitness space with a focused skill set.<br/></p>",
            "right_text_size": "copy-l",
            "right_text_no_decal": false,
            "right_text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "textcol_A4w7Fw": {
          "type": "textcol",
          "settings": {
            "left_text": "<p></p><p><strong>Flexible Working Environment</strong></p><p><br/>Qualified Pilates instructors can work across a variety of settings, including:</p><ul><li>Boutique Pilates studios</li><li>Commercial gyms and health clubs</li><li>Private wellness centres</li><li>Freelance or self-employed settings</li><li>Online or virtual coaching platforms</li></ul><p><br/></p>",
            "left_text_size": "copy-l",
            "left_text_no_decal": false,
            "left_text_strong_accented": false,
            "right_text": "<p></p><p><strong>Career Progression Opportunities</strong></p><p><br/>A Pilates qualification can open the door to further specialisation and career development. This allows you to expand your expertise and work with a broader range of clients.</p><p></p><p>Many instructors progress into:</p><ul><li>Advanced Pilates training (e.g. reformer, clinical Pilates)</li><li>Pre and postnatal exercise specialisms</li><li>Injury rehabilitation and corrective exercise</li><li>Holistic health and wellness coaching<br/></li></ul>",
            "right_text_size": "copy-l",
            "right_text_no_decal": false,
            "right_text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        }
      },
