          "type": "subheadline",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Gym instructors are responsible for creating a <strong>safe, supportive, and motivating training environment</strong> for gym members. Their role involves supervising the gym floor, helping members use equipment correctly, and designing simple workout programmes for beginners. </p><p></p><p>Below are some of the <strong>main responsibilities of a gym instructor</strong> in a typical gym or health club environment. <br/></p>",
            "text_align": "left",
            "text_width": "full",
            "text_size": "copy-l",
            "text_no_decal": false,
            "text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 16,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "textcol_7kaeFQ": {
          "type": "textcol",
          "settings": {
            "left_text": "<p></p><p><strong>Member Inductions</strong><br/><br/>Introduce new members to the gym, explain how equipment works, and demonstrate safe usage.<br/><strong><br/>Programme Design</strong><br/><br/>Create simple, structured gym programmes that help members achieve their fitness goals.<br/><br/><strong>Member Support and Motivation</strong><br/><br/>Provide guidance, encouragement, and ongoing support to help members stay consistent with their training.<br/></p>",
            "left_text_size": "copy-l",
            "left_text_no_decal": false,
            "left_text_strong_accented": false,
            "right_text": "<p></p><p><strong>Exercise Demonstration</strong></p><p><br/>Show correct technique for strength training exercises and cardiovascular equipment.<br/><br/><strong>Health and Safety Supervision</strong></p><p></p><p>Monitor activity on the gym floor, ensure equipment is used correctly, and follow gym safety procedures.<br/></p><p></p>",
            "right_text_size": "copy-l",
            "right_text_no_decal": false,
            "right_text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "subheadline_LfcfkB": {
          "type": "subheadline",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p></p><p><strong>Key Skills Involved:</strong> Communication, Anatomy Knowledge, Observation, Interpersonal Skills etc.</p>",
            "text_align": "left",
            "text_width": "full",
            "text_size": "copy-l",
            "text_no_decal": false,
            "text_strong_accented": false,
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        }
      },
